"showUnpreparedSpells":{"value":false},"displayLevels":{}},"_id":"8uBdHE57Y3O4DSEn","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/spellcastingEntry.svg","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688831914213,"modifiedTime":1688831936007,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/control-water.webp","name":"Control Water","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>By imposing your will upon the water, you can raise or lower the level of water in the chosen area by 10 feet. Water creatures in the area are subjected to the effects of <em>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.WsUwpfmhKrKwoIe3]{Slow}</em>.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Area</strong> 50 ft long by 50 ft wide</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"control-water","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","water"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":5},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":"500 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"8uBdHE57Y3O4DSEn","heightenedLevel":5},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688831926046,"modifiedTime":1688831926046,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.zfn5RqAdF63neqpP","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"r0X7IZzvqcGxLwvc"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/hydraulic-torrent.webp","name":"Hydraulic Torrent","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A swirling torrent of water manifests along a straight line, battering creatures and unattended objects in its path and possibly pushing them away from you. The torrent deals 8d6 bludgeoning damage. Each creature in the area must attempt a basic Fortitude save; unattended objects automatically fail. Creatures that fail the save are also knocked back 5 feet (10 feet on a critical failure).</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 2d6.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"hydraulic-torrent","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","water"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":4},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":""},"area":{"type":"line","value":60},"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{"0":{"applyMod":false,"formula":"8d6","type":"bludgeoning","category":null,"materials":[],"kinds":["damage"]}},"defense":{"passive":null,"save":{"statistic":"fortitude","basic":true}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"8uBdHE57Y3O4DSEn","heightenedLevel":4,"uses":{"max":2,"value":2}},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"damage":{"0":"2d6"},"interval":1,"type":"interval"}},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688831931545,"modifiedTime":1688831933903,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Y3G6Y6EDgCY0s3fq","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"TF1qkTnp2RvKOibo"},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Healing Waves","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The kawakami is currently in a restorative state</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The kawakami surrounds up to two creatures within 30 feet (which can include itself) in restorative, obscuring water, and then reverts to their destructive state and can't use this ability for [[/br 1d4 #rounds]]{1d4 rounds}. The targeted creatures recover @Damage[10d6[healing]] Hit Points, and gains @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{Concealement} against all enemies for one round.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":2},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"vo9rxnuOvKiolIgR","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.3.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688831950070,"modifiedTime":1691261013408,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Intercepting Swell","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The kawakami is currently in a restorative state</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature within 15 feet damages the kawakami or an adjacent ally</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> Healing water blocks the blow, reducing the damage by 8, and granting the damaged creature fast healing 5 for the next 2 rounds.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e.pf2e-battlezoo-su-effects.Item.ODsXzZcN89GBDAJa]{Effect: Intercepting Swell}</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"tEKBAvIdKk8I70NR","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688831950783,"modifiedTime":1688832325071,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Hydropulse","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The kawakami is currently in a destructive state</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> Once per round</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The kawakami unleashes a powerful explosion of water. All creatures within a @Template[type:emanation|distance:10] of the kawakami take @Damage[5d6[bludgeoning]] damage (@Check[type:reflex|dc:26|basic:true] save). On a failure, the creature is also knocked @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Prone]{Prone}.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["primal","water"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":1},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"zpxKy3W3C2q8c1w9","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.3.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688831951728,"modifiedTime":1691261013424,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Suffocating Ripple","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The kawakami is currently in a destructive state</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The kawakami targets a creature within 100 feet from which a @Template[type:emanation|distance:10] of water and mud rapidly swells, and then reverts to a restorative state and can't use this ability for [[/br 1d4 #rounds]]{1d4 rounds}. All creatures within the emanation take @Damage[10d6[bludgeoning]] damage (@Check[type:reflex|dc:28|basic:true] save). On a failure, the target must also attempt a @Check[type:fortitude|dc:28] save, and they must start holding their breath on a failure. The affected creature, or any adjacent creature, can use an Interact action to clear the suffocating creature's airway.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["primal","water"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":2},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"ScSljr7NY49FvXbP","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.3.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688831952316,"modifiedTime":1691261013440,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}],"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"6.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1685401626117,"modifiedTime":1736542896390,"lastModifiedBy":"l2rbNx2a8f5ocpeL","compendiumSource":null,"dupli